# Attribution and bundled notices

The Waffle gh package is an original TypeScript compatibility adapter. Its behavior and fixtures were developed against GitHub CLI 2.103.0 and its public documentation:

- https://github.com/cli/cli/tree/v2.103.0
- https://github.com/cli/go-gh/tree/v2.17.0
- https://docs.github.com/en/rest

No cli/cli or go-gh source code is copied or bundled. The bundled script has no third-party JavaScript runtime dependencies.

The optional jq package supplies the real jaq evaluator as a separate installed program. Its Wasm and license notices are not part of this package.
